    in -w pin [pull] [rise|fall|any] [-t s]   wait until the pin
                        changes (interrupt, no busy loop). A change
                        must last 20 ms, so switch bounce doesn't
                        count. -t gives up after s seconds, up to
                        86400 ($? 1).
                        Button to GND: in -w 14 up fall

